    "bio": "I am Jeremy Lim, an undergraduate at International Christian University in Tokyo, studying Linguistics and Information Science. My academic interests center on computational linguistics, speech science, and low-resource language research, especially Southern Min (Hokkien).\n\nBeyond research, I am involved in photography, writing, and interdisciplinary collaboration. I am interested in how faith, technology, and human dignity interact in the age of AI.",
